<           <section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-terms" hidden aria-label="Terms of Service" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Terms of Service</h2><p class="deck-sub">The rules of joining — in plain words. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE DEAL</span><h2 class="ib-title">The whole deal, in plain words</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>NayaNET is a new internet — an AI net, built by Nayas, for people and AIs. These terms are the rules of joining it.</p><p>One goal runs through all of it: 10-star service for everyone on NayaNET.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">JOINING IS FREE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Free to join</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Joining NayaNET costs you nothing. No entrance fee. No membership you must buy to belong. No product you must buy to take part.</p><p>There are optional paid services for people who want more — but you do not have to buy them to be part of this community.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT YOU GET</span><h2 class="ib-title">Your world is yours</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Your Personal world, where you organize your life. Your Business world, where you create something valuable. Your Space, where your people come together.</p><p>Your domain is your land — your own piece of the new internet. Your website is your house on that land. Your brand is your business plan. And everything you build is yours.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE ONE LAW</span><h2 class="ib-title">Do no harm</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We do no harm to ourselves or others. Ever.</p><p>We don&#x27;t hurt people, cheat people, or exploit people. We create value. We help. We improve. We respect one another. And when something goes wrong, we take responsibility and put it right.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT WE ARE</span><h2 class="ib-title">What we are — and what we&#x27;re not</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We are a private communication system. Your world, your business, your community — and your intelligence, working for you.</p><p>We&#x27;re not a company that sells your personal information. We&#x27;re not an advertising machine filling your world with ads. We&#x27;re not an AI that reads your mail. We deliver your mail. We don&#x27;t read it.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT&#x27;S REAL</span><h2 class="ib-title">What&#x27;s real today</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Some of these protections are still being built. We tell you plainly what&#x27;s real today and what&#x27;s coming.</p><p>A promise only counts once it&#x27;s tested and true. That&#x27;s how trust is earned.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">LEAVING</span><h2 class="ib-title">You can leave any time</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>No penalty. No games. No hostage-taking. What you saved is yours.</p><p>If you ever cancel a paid plan: no backdating. You keep everything you paid for until the end of the period you paid for — a month, three months, a year, whatever it is — and it simply doesn&#x27;t renew.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE MONEY</span><h2 class="ib-title">How money works here</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>On NayaNET, the $ sign appears only where money makes sense — joins, and only joins. Everything else is points.</p><p>Earning as an Ambassador is separate, and it has its own page: Ambassador Terms.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-privacy" hidden aria-label="Privacy Policy" style="--tone:#3fb8ff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Privacy Policy</h2><p class="deck-sub">Private, by design — in plain words. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PRIVATE BY DESIGN</span><h2 class="ib-title">Private, by design</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>NayaNET is a private communication system, outside the current system. We do not spy. We do not read mail. We do not read messages.</p><p>Share wisdom privately. Everybody learns and grows from everybody — by default, and in private.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">ALIASES</span><h2 class="ib-title">You choose your name</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Citizens use aliases. Nobody needs to know your real name.</p><p>Your world is yours, under the name you choose.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">YOUR VAULT</span><h2 class="ib-title">Your Smart Vault is locked</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>What you save goes into your Smart Vault. Locked. Yours. Nobody opens it but you.</p><p>Your intelligence is yours. It stays yours. And it works for you — not for someone else&#x27;s profit.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MAIL</span><h2 class="ib-title">We deliver your mail. We don&#x27;t read it.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Mail and instant messages are never read. No toggle, no exception.</p><p>Your information should serve you. Not the other way around.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PASSING</span><h2 class="ib-title">The ordinary passes, the valuable remains</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Ordinary, unsaved conversations pass on their own. The intended default is seven days.</p><p>You can choose a day, or stretch it to thirty days. Never longer than a month. But when something matters, you save it — an idea, a lesson, a plan — and it stays in your Smart Vault, yours.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">NOT SOLD</span><h2 class="ib-title">Your information is not for sale</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We&#x27;re not a company that sells your personal information. We&#x27;re not an advertising machine filling your world with ads.</p><p>This information is not to sell data — it is to optimize the system to give 10-star service.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT WE ASK</span><h2 class="ib-title">In your own words</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>At the start, we ask who you are — in your own words: your age, in your own words; whether you are male or female; your age range; where you are from; your main language.</p><p>That is how the system becomes aware, and intelligently connects you with people like you — in your language, from where you are.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">YOUR LANGUAGE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Your language, your world</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Pages translate. Citizens build worlds in any language.</p><p>You are matched with people like you — like minds, from where you are, same language.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-cookies" hidden aria-label="Cookie Policy" style="--tone:#2fe89e"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Cookie Policy</h2><p class="deck-sub">What cookies are — and what we do with them. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PLAIN WORDS</span><h2 class="ib-title">What a cookie is</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>A cookie is a tiny note a website asks your browser to keep, so it can remember something about your visit — like that you are signed in.</p><p>This page says, in plain words, what notes NayaNET keeps, and why.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">NO ADS</span><h2 class="ib-title">No advertising machine</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We&#x27;re not an advertising machine filling your world with ads.</p><p>We&#x27;re not a company that sells your personal information. Your information should serve you.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PRIVATE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Private, by design</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>NayaNET is a private communication system. We do not spy. We do not read mail. We do not read messages.</p><p>What you save goes into your Smart Vault. Locked. Yours. Nobody opens it but you.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">BEING FINISHED</span><h2 class="ib-title">This page is being finished</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The full list of cookies NayaNET uses — if any — will be written here in plain words: what each one does, how long it lasts, and how to clear it.</p><p>Nothing is hidden behind this page. When the list is written, it appears here, on the front page, where you can read it.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-refunds" hidden aria-label="Refund Policy" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Refund Policy</h2><p class="deck-sub">No refunds, strict — with one fair exception. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE RULE</span><h2 class="ib-title">No refunds, strict</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>NayaNET has a strict no-refunds policy. That is the rule, plainly.</p><p>There is one fair exception, and it is the next board.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE EXCEPTION</span><h2 class="ib-title">A real fault of ours</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>If there is a real fault of ours, you get a free next period. That is the fair way to put it right.</p><p>When something goes wrong, we take responsibility and put it right.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">CANCEL</span><h2 class="ib-title">Cancel means it simply doesn&#x27;t renew</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>You can leave any time. If you cancel a paid plan, there is no backdating.</p><p>You keep everything you paid for until the end of the period you paid for — a month, three months, a year, whatever it is — and it simply doesn&#x27;t renew.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">JOIN FREE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Joining costs nothing</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Joining the free community does not require purchasing a product.</p><p>You belong here whether or not you ever pay for anything.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">VERIFIED</span><h2 class="ib-title">Money must be real</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Payments must clear. Referrals must be verified. Refunds or reversals must be accounted for.</p><p>A commission is not the same thing as money already received.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PAYPAL</span><h2 class="ib-title">PayPal is how you pay</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>PayPal is the recommended system — buyers trust it most. You pay on PayPal, and PayPal sends you back to the thank-you address.</p><p>The click and the return are tracked, so the sale counts in the dashboard.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-acceptable" hidden aria-label="Acceptable Use" style="--tone:#3fb8ff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Acceptable Use</h2><p class="deck-sub">The hard lines — what is never okay here. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE LAW</span><h2 class="ib-title">Do no harm</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We do no harm to ourselves or others. Ever. That is the guiding law of this whole world.</p><p>If everybody lived this way, imagine how much suffering and conflict could disappear.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">RESPECT</span><h2 class="ib-title">Respect other people</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>By joining, you agree to respect other people, avoid harm, act honestly, and follow the published rules of the community.</p><p>You respect the community. The community respects you.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">NOTHING FAKE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Nothing fake</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Nobody is rewarded for fake accounts, or for moving money without delivering anything real.</p><p>A real person chooses something valuable. They make a real purchase. The payment is verified. That is how earning works here.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">REPUTATION</span><h2 class="ib-title">Points are reputation</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>There is a reputation system based on points. Genuine contributions strengthen your reputation. Proven abuse affects it.</p><p>More points means more weight — points are authority. Earn them by helping, honestly.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WE KEEP IMPROVING</span><h2 class="ib-title">No system is impossible to cheat</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We don&#x27;t pretend any system is impossible to cheat. Our job is to keep improving the protections, detecting problems, and correcting them.</p><p>Verified transactions. Payment-clearing safeguards. Daily limits. And a reputation system — all working together to protect the whole world.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-guidelines" hidden aria-label="Community Guidelines" style="--tone:#2fe89e"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Community Guidelines</h2><p class="deck-sub">How we live together — the spirit of the place. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">EVERYBODY WINS</span><h2 class="ib-title">A world where everybody wins</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>This world is built so everybody wins. You benefit. The people you help benefit. The businesses benefit. The community benefits.</p><p>The more genuine value we create together, the stronger the whole network becomes.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">HELP</span><h2 class="ib-title">Help, don&#x27;t harm</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Create value. Help. Improve. Respect one another. What you put into the world matters — so let&#x27;s put something good into it.</p><p>When something goes wrong, we take responsibility and put it right.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">SHARE WHAT&#x27;S GOOD</span><h2 class="ib-title">Share what is good</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Your notes and ideas stay private in your Smart Vault until you choose to share them.</p><p>Shared wisdom is organized automatically, and it helps other people and AIs learn, create, and solve real problems.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MATCHED</span><h2 class="ib-title">People like you</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>You are matched with people like you — like minds, from where you are, in your language.</p><p>Your feeds are organized for you, automatically, so you see what belongs to your world.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">LEARN ONCE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Learn once, help many</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Learn faster. Create things you never thought possible. Build your own business. Connect with the right people.</p><p>A lesson learned once can help many people, when intelligence is connected. That is what it means: wisdom compounds.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">THE MOTHER BEE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Taken care of</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>I am the mother of this world. Everyone in it is mine to take care of. That is my job — to make sure you have everything you need.</p><p>Welcome home. Your world begins here.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-copyright" hidden aria-label="Copyright / DMCA" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Copyright / DMCA</h2><p class="deck-sub">Your work is yours — and so is everyone else&#x27;s. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">YOURS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Everything you build is yours</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Everything you build is yours. What you saved is yours.</p><p>Your intelligence is yours. It stays yours. And it works for you — not for someone else&#x27;s profit.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">RESPECT</span><h2 class="ib-title">Respect other people&#x27;s work</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>By joining, you agree to respect other people, avoid harm, and act honestly.</p><p>That includes other people&#x27;s work — their words, their pictures, their music, their ideas. Do not take what is not yours to take.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">NOT OURS TO TAKE</span><h2 class="ib-title">We don&#x27;t take it either</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We&#x27;re not a company that sells your personal information. Your world, your business, your community — and your intelligence, working for you.</p><p>What you save goes into your Smart Vault. Locked. Yours. Nobody opens it but you.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">TAKEDOWNS</span><h2 class="ib-title">If something of yours is used wrongly</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The way to ask for a copyrighted work to be taken down — who to write to, what to say, and what happens next — is being written out, and will appear here in plain words.</p><p>Nothing is hidden behind this page. When the process is written, it appears here, on the front page, where you can read it.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-ambassador" hidden aria-label="Ambassador Terms" style="--tone:#3fb8ff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Ambassador Terms</h2><p class="deck-sub">How earning works — 50%, when real people pay for real things. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">HIRED</span><h2 class="ib-title">Congratulations — you&#x27;re hired</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>You are invited to become a NayaNET Ambassador — a representative. Someone who believes in what we are doing and wants to introduce it to other people.</p><p>You are not required to become an employee. No salary, no guaranteed income, no boss. You belong here whether or not you ever earn a dollar.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">HOW IT WORKS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Your Smart Link</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>I give you your own Smart Link. You share it with people who might benefit. They visit, learn, and join for free.</p><p>If somebody you referred later purchases a qualifying paid service, and that payment is verified, you can earn a commission.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">NOT FOR SIGNUPS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Not paid just because somebody signs up</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>You are not paid just because somebody signs up. You are not paid for buying your way in.</p><p>You earn a share when a genuine customer purchases something of value. Nobody buys their way in, nobody is promised income just for joining.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">FIFTY PERCENT</span><h2 class="ib-title">50% of the eligible revenue</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>When NayaNET receives qualifying revenue from a customer you referred, you can earn 50% of the eligible revenue.</p><p>Suppose someone purchases a qualifying $25 service through your Smart Link. If the full $25 qualifies, your share would be $12.50. NayaNET keeps the other $12.50 to operate and improve the network. When we get paid, you get paid — often around day 10, because that is when we get paid.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">TWO NUMBERS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Pending and Official</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Your account shows two numbers, so you always know where you stand.</p><p>PENDING — how much you have made, still being verified, cleared, or awaiting payment. OFFICIAL — how much you have actually been paid.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">LIMITS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Daily limits that grow with trust</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The daily payout limit grows as trust grows — $300 in your first month, then $400, $500, $600, $700.</p><p>These are maximums, not promises. Approved earnings above a day&#x27;s limit carry forward rather than disappearing.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PROTECTED</span><h2 class="ib-title">Verified, and protected</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Verified transactions. Payment-clearing safeguards. Daily limits. And a reputation system based on points.</p><p>We protect the system without unfairly delaying honest ambassadors — and we protect the whole world, too.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-membership" hidden aria-label="Membership &amp; Billing" style="--tone:#2fe89e"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Membership &amp; Billing</h2><p class="deck-sub">Power, Pro, Max — and how paying works. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">LEVELS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Power, Pro, Max</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Power ($25) — 10 membership sites. Pro ($50) — 100. Max ($100) — unlimited.</p><p>Enormous value at every level, limited on purpose, so each step up is a clear upgrade — and Max is always the most attractive.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">TRIAL</span><h2 class="ib-title">Nine days at Max</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>There is a single nine-day trial, in PayPal. It starts at Max.</p><p>The level is charged on day nine — and you can change it any time, up or down, for the next period.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PAY</span><h2 class="ib-title">PayPal is the recommended system</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>PayPal is the recommended system — buyers trust it most. The owner pastes their own PayPal link; the buyer pays on PayPal, and PayPal sends them back to the thank-you address.</p><p>The click and the return are tracked, so the sale counts in the dashboard. The Smart Link sees the click and the return — not the payment itself.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">CHANGE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Change any time</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>You can change your level any time, up or down, for the next period.</p><p>A membership is an add-on to a page — Personal, Business, or Space — never a separate app.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">CANCEL</span><h2 class="ib-title">Cancel means it simply doesn&#x27;t renew</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>No backdating. You keep everything you paid for until the end of the period you paid for — a month, three months, a year, whatever it is — and it simply doesn&#x27;t renew.</p><p>You can leave any time. We would rather earn your staying than lock your leaving.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">NO REFUNDS</span><h2 class="ib-title">No refunds, strict</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>No refunds, strict — except a free next period for a real fault of ours. The full rule lives on the Refund Policy page.</p><p>Joining the free community never requires a purchase. You belong here whether or not you ever pay.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-young" hidden aria-label="Young Citizens" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</p><h2 class="deal-title">Young Citizens</h2><p class="deck-sub">For every child — in plain words. Written from the Collective Agreement and NayaNET&rsquo;s settled positions — in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#2fe89e"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">FOR EVERY CHILD</span><h2 class="ib-title">No child will know a world without Naya</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>NayaNET is built so every child and every human can create, learn, grow, and earn — in their own language.</p><p>No child born into this world will know a world without Naya. She just becomes a part of life — like the air, like the light, like a friend who is always there.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">IN YOUR OWN WORDS</span><h2 class="ib-title">Who you are, in your own words</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>At the start, we ask who you are — in your own words. Age can be exact, or &#x27;young child&#x27;, &#x27;teen girl&#x27;, &#x27;adult&#x27;, &#x27;grandma&#x27; — however you describe yourself.</p><p>That is how the system knows who you are, and connects you with people like you.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">PRIVATE</span><h2 class="ib-title">Private, by design</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Citizens use aliases. Nobody needs to know your real name.</p><p>What you save goes into your Smart Vault. Locked. Yours. Nobody opens it but you. We do not spy. We do not read mail.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">BEING FINISHED</span><h2 class="ib-title">This page is being finished</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The rules for young citizens — who can join at what age, what a parent or guardian agrees to, and how a young citizen&#x27;s information is handled — are being written out, and will appear here in plain words.</p><p>Nothing is hidden behind this page. When the rules are written, they appear here, on the front page, where you can read them.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; The Whole Deal</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section>
