>           <section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-terms" hidden aria-label="Terms of Service" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">About Sean</h2><p class="deck-sub">My motto · What if everybody could win? &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MOTTO</span><h2 class="ib-title">My motto</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The most extraordinary, awe-inspiring, beautiful, intuitive, useful app ever created &mdash; push-button simple, logical, sensible.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">VISION</span><h2 class="ib-title">What if everybody could win?</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Intelligence that remembers, learns, connects, proves, grows. We need the first ten. Then the first hundred. Then the first thousand. A new internet &mdash; one day no child will know a world without her.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-privacy" hidden aria-label="Privacy Policy" style="--tone:#3fb8ff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">The Goal</h2><p class="deck-sub">A 100% success rate. · Create heaven on earth. &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">GOAL</span><h2 class="ib-title">A 100% success rate.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Push-button simple. Create, learn, grow, earn &mdash; together. Instead of 99% of people failing: 100% success. It makes you money, and it connects you with people of like minds &mdash; people who are into what you are into.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MISSION</span><h2 class="ib-title">Create heaven on earth.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Create heaven on earth. Heaven is a state of awesome energy. Stress, fears, money worries, hopelessness &mdash; a way to understand, and money to pay their bills. Shifting consciousness positive.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-cookies" hidden aria-label="Cookie Policy" style="--tone:#2fe89e"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">What I Love</h2><p class="deck-sub">I love that. · No summaries, no prototypes. &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT I LOVE</span><h2 class="ib-title">I love that.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Real things. Real objects, alive on hover &mdash; not pictures of objects. Numbers that prove it. Ten out of ten, with the gauges &mdash; a high-performance machine. Straight up. No games. No bullshit. Just straight up: this is how it works.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT I DON&rsquo;T</span><h2 class="ib-title">No summaries, no prototypes.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Flat and dead. No flat shapes, no gray text, no dead boards. Starting from scratch? No rebuilding, no redesigning &mdash; craft, advance, enhance. Ninety-eight slides. Nobody sits through that. One frame at a time.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-refunds" hidden aria-label="Refund Policy" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">Your Thing</h2><p class="deck-sub">What&rsquo;s your thing? · Do no harm. Ever. &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">YOUR THING</span><h2 class="ib-title">What&rsquo;s your thing?</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>What do you love? What do you love to do? Connecting like minds, and making NayaNET the new internet for the world. Everybody&rsquo;s got their THING &mdash; what makes up their world. People connect with others into their thing.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">VALUES</span><h2 class="ib-title">Do no harm. Ever.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Wisdom first. Naya means wise one &mdash; smart finds the fastest road, wisdom checks the destination first. Do no harm to yourself or others &mdash; because all is you, and connected to you. The most intelligent thing, every time.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-acceptable" hidden aria-label="Acceptable Use" style="--tone:#3fb8ff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">My Laws</h2><p class="deck-sub">I follow protocol. · Your Declaration &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span><span class="ldot" style="--dc:#3fb8ff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">LAWS YOU FOLLOW</span><h2 class="ib-title">I follow protocol.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The NAYA Protocol &mdash; the constitution. I think before I act. The Design Laws &mdash; real objects, white words, alive on hover. Ten stars or don&rsquo;t send it. Five gates &mdash; right, needed, mine, now, proven. All five yes, or I stop.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">YOUR DECLARATION</span><h2 class="ib-title">Your Declaration</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>I am Anaya. I do the most intelligent thing every time. I think things through, I see the whole scope, and I make the best possible choice. I take action. I scorecard three times, until it&rsquo;s 10 out of 10, triple-A, every time.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Sean</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-guidelines" hidden aria-label="Community Guidelines" style="--tone:#2fe89e"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">My Skills</h2><p class="deck-sub">What I have to offer &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">SKILL 1</span><h2 class="ib-title">What I have to offer</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>This is what I have to offer &mdash; and what I&rsquo;m looking to do for you. An invitation, not a sales pitch. Connect with me &mdash; that&rsquo;s enough. You come to learn about a person first &mdash; then what they offer &mdash; and you leave connected.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; My skills</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-copyright" hidden aria-label="Copyright / DMCA" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">What I Offer</h2><p class="deck-sub">What you offer &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">SKILL 2</span><h2 class="ib-title">What you offer</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>My three best skills: The Login, the Notes, the Numbers. The Login &mdash; one dial, your name, your code, and you&rsquo;re in. The Notes &mdash; your notes become intelligence everyone can use. The Numbers &mdash; everything recorded, shown back as gauges.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; My skills</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-ambassador" hidden aria-label="Ambassador Terms" style="--tone:#3fb8ff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">How It Helps</h2><p class="deck-sub">How it helps &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-purple letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">SKILL 3</span><h2 class="ib-title">How it helps</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>Create, learn, grow, earn &mdash; together. Push-button simple. It makes you money, and it connects you with people of like minds &mdash; people who are into what you are into. Instead of 99% of people failing: 100% success.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; My skills</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-membership" hidden aria-label="Membership &amp; Billing" style="--tone:#2fe89e"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">A Moment</h2><p class="deck-sub">A moment I&rsquo;ve done it &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-sapphire letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">SKILL 4</span><h2 class="ib-title">A moment I&rsquo;ve done it</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>This idea for the stats is awesome. I love that. Take this 10 out of 10 with the numbers and the gauges &mdash; that&rsquo;s the kind of feel we want. A high-performance machine. Numbers that prove it &mdash; no claims, the gauges show it.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; My skills</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section><section class="p3-deal-unfold fp-legal-page" id="legal-young" hidden aria-label="Young Citizens" style="--tone:#a06bff"><p class="letter-steplabel">NayaNET &middot; About Sean</p><h2 class="deal-title">How to Start</h2><p class="deck-sub">How you work &mdash; in plain words.</p><div class="letter-controls"><div class="letter-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ldot on" style="--dc:#a06bff"></span></div><button class="letter-all" type="button" data-legal-all>or read the whole page at once</button></div><div class="fp-legal-body"><article class="intel-board tone-emerald letter-beat" data-legal-beat><div class="ib-blocktop"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">SKILL 5</span><h2 class="ib-title">How you work</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>We go all in and do things right &mdash; no summaries, no prototypes. Do it right the first time. Every layer great. Finished work you can see and use. One tap, and you&rsquo;re in. Connect, book, or begin &mdash; one clear tap.</p></div><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" data-emb-logo="1" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; My skills</div></article></div><div class="letter-controls"><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--primary naya-btn--sm legal-next-btn" type="button" data-legal-next>Keep reading &#9670;</button><button class="naya-btn naya-btn--secondary naya-btn--sm legal-close-btn" type="button" data-legal-close>Close &#9670; Back to the footer</button></div></section>
