<  {t:"The Old Way", x:"Look at this desk, my friend. Too many apps, too many alerts, and everything scattered everywhere. <strong>Every single day, you have to start all over again.</strong> I know how heavy that feels &mdash; and please hear me: it is not your fault.", a:"A woman overwhelmed at a desk buried in apps, alerts, and tangled cables"},
<  {t:"Welcome", x:"Hi, I&rsquo;m Naya, and I am so glad you&rsquo;re here. <strong>This is your world</strong> &mdash; one warm home where everything you learn, build, and share can live together, safe and sound.", a:"Naya reaching out her hand in a glowing crystal city beneath a giant crystal N"},
<  {t:"The Collective Intelligence Network", x:"On one side is your private <strong>Smart Vault</strong>, where your treasures stay yours and yours alone. On the other side is the wisdom we all share together. <strong>One gentle engine connects the two</strong> &mdash; and you always hold the key.", a:"Diagram of the NayaNET collective intelligence engine: people, AIs, friends, communities, knowledge, notes and wisdom flowing into the NayaPOWER engine, above Personal, Business and Space"},
<  {t:"Your Worlds", x:"You get four worlds, and every one of them belongs to you: your Personal world, your Business world, your Space, and your Dashboard. <strong>Four powerful worlds, one connected system &mdash; all yours.</strong>", a:"Four glowing orbs — Personal, Business, Space, and Dashboard plus Hub — connected around Naya"},
<  {t:"In a Nutshell", x:"Here it is, simple and true. You learn something. I organize it for you, with love. <strong>And then the right people can learn from it too.</strong> That is NayaNET, in a nutshell.", a:"In a nutshell: you, your notes, the NayaNET engine, and wisdom flowing to friends, communities and AIs"},
<  {t:"The System", x:"Behind the scenes, quiet helpers are working for you day and night &mdash; the Ledger, the Factory, your Smart Vault, Auto-Match, and Ask Naya. <strong>You never have to see the machinery. You just feel how easy everything becomes.</strong>", a:"The System: the Ledger, the Factory, Smart Box and Vault, Auto-Match, and Ask Naya around a central intelligence"},
<  {t:"How It Works", x:"It begins with you, and it begins in private &mdash; always. Your wisdom is yours first. <strong>You share only what you choose, when you choose to share it.</strong> And I organize it all for you, automatically, so nothing precious is ever lost.", a:"How it works in five steps: capture, keep in your Smart Vault, choose to share, organize, and help others"},
<  {t:"Your Day", x:"Imagine opening one door in the morning and finding your whole day waiting for you &mdash; your feed, your mail, your notes, your people, and your learning, all together. <strong>Everything you need, every day, in one place.</strong>", a:"Daily: Feed and Today, Mail and Messenger, Notes and Lists, Connections and Learning, from morning align to night grow"},
<  {t:"My World", x:"Pick any day you like, and I will show you your world. <strong>See what yesterday taught you. Plan what tomorrow can become.</strong> Your life, laid out before you like a story you can read.", a:"My World calendar for November 2026 with a day panel showing dashboard, worlds, the day at a glance, and appointments"},
<  {t:"The Simple Version", x:"Think of it like this, the simple way: a private brain that keeps your things safe, and a friendly library that we all share. <strong>Find the wisdom you need, stay close to your people, and never feel lost again.</strong>", a:"The grandma version: Naya with a grandmother at a laptop, between a private Smart Vault and the shared community library"},
<  {t:"For AIs", x:"Your AIs forget you every time you close the window &mdash; but here, they don&rsquo;t have to. <strong>One shared brain lets every AI remember you, learn, and work together for you.</strong>", a:"For AIs: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Midjourney, Copilot, Llama, Muse and more, all working from one shared, authorized brain"},
<  {t:"Your AIs, Together", x:"One AI researches for you. One creates. One keeps your numbers straight. <strong>Together, they collaborate, they coordinate, and they deliver for you</strong> &mdash; like a little team that never sleeps.", a:"Naya surrounded by six AIs — research, creative, analytics, productivity, automation, support — all connected around you"},
<  {t:"The Mother Brain", x:"All of your AIs learn together here, growing wiser for you every day. And please don&rsquo;t worry &mdash; <strong>your vault stays locked, encrypted, and yours alone.</strong> No one else can peek inside. Ever.", a:"The Mother Brain: a glowing brain with the crystal N, ringed by private domes where each person works with their AI behind a locked vault"},
<  {t:"The Machine View", x:"Underneath it all, your intelligence flows through one governed system &mdash; calm, ordered, and safe. <strong>No more scattered tools. No more chaos.</strong> Just one river, flowing the right way, carrying you with it.", a:"The machine view: input doors, governed intelligence, the private Smart Vault and collective intelligence, your worlds, and outcomes"},
<  {t:"What It Means", x:"Here is the beautiful part, so listen close. When you learn a lesson, it doesn&rsquo;t have to end with you. <strong>Wisdom compounds</strong> &mdash; one lesson, learned once, can go on to help many, many people.", a:"What it means: people, families, creators, teachers, businesses and communities connected around the NayaNET network above the Earth"},
<  {t:"Plug In", x:"Getting started is as easy as plugging in a lamp. Choose Free, Naya Power, Pro, or Max &mdash; whichever fits your life. <strong>Plug in, power up, and connect your AI whenever you&rsquo;re ready.</strong>", a:"Naya plugging a glowing connector into an AI, with Free, Naya Power, Pro and Max levels below"},
<  {t:"Why It Matters", x:"The old internet is scattered and noisy, and it wears you out. NayaNET is connected and kind. <strong>Less chaos. More understanding.</strong> That is why this matters &mdash; for you, and for everyone you love.", a:"Why it matters: the fragmented old internet transforming into the connected, organized, human-centered NayaNET"},
<  {t:"The Naya Machine", x:"At the very heart of it all is <strong>one living intelligence</strong> &mdash; built with care, and waiting just for you. The moment you plug in, it wakes up and goes to work for you.", a:"A luminous machine orb holding the crystal N and the profile of a woman, with its connector cable resting in front"},
<  {t:"For AIs", x:"This part is for your AIs, so let me speak to them directly: here, you can remember. Here, you can learn from each other. <strong>One brain, shared with permission, makes every one of you better</strong> &mdash; and the humans you serve happier.", a:"For AIs: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Midjourney, Copilot, Llama, Muse and more, all working from one shared, authorized brain"},
<  {t:"Your Three Worlds", x:"Your life gets three homes, and each one has its own door. <strong>Personal</strong> &mdash; that&rsquo;s your life. <strong>Business</strong> &mdash; that&rsquo;s your work. And <strong>Your Thing</strong> &mdash; that&rsquo;s your passion, and the people who love it right along with you.", a:"Your three worlds: Personal, Business, and Your Thing, in three glowing orbs above Naya"},
<  {t:"The Whole-System Unfolding", x:"Now let me unfold the whole gift for you, piece by piece: your Worlds, your Daily life, the System, your Own Worlds, and the Platform. <strong>Everything you get, presented the same simple way</strong> &mdash; so you always know where you are.", a:"The Whole-System Unfolding: a five-part list — Your Worlds, Daily, The System, Your Own Worlds, The Platform"},
<  {t:"Done For You", x:"Your mail, your notes, your people, your feeds, your tasks &mdash; handled, every one. Picture yourself with a warm coffee, breathing easy. <strong>The work is done for you, and your world is in order.</strong>", a:"A woman relaxing with coffee while Naya's panel shows mail, notes, people, feeds and tasks all marked Handled"},
<  {t:"The Platform", x:"Under your feet is a deep, strong foundation &mdash; private, secure, and always quietly improving itself. <strong>You don&rsquo;t have to think about it. You just get to stand on it</strong> and build your world.", a:"The Platform: a layered machine city — points and reputation, collective chain ledger, optimization engine, secure vault architecture"},
<  {t:"Your Own Worlds", x:"Now the door opens wider, just for you. You can open worlds of your own and invite others in &mdash; <strong>and yes, you&rsquo;re hired</strong>: you earn <strong>50%</strong> every time one of your members joins.", a:"Your Own Worlds: membership doors for Personal, Business and Space, beside the Ambassador panel — You're Hired, 50 percent"},
<  {t:"What&rsquo;s In It For You", x:"So, what&rsquo;s in it for you? Everything. Join free. Build your world. Drink from our shared wisdom whenever you&rsquo;re thirsty. <strong>Your world begins here</strong> &mdash; and I will be with you for every step of it.", a:"What's in it for you: collective intelligence, connect your AI, Personal, Business and Space, and the Join Us — Enter NayaNET door"},
<  {t:"You&rsquo;re Hired", x:"This card is real, and it has your name on it. Your world, your people, your place in the collective. <strong>Welcome home.</strong>", a:"Naya holding a glowing You're Hired card with 50 percent, between the Personal, Business and Community worlds"},
<  {t:"Your Franchise", x:"And if you want it all done for you &mdash; the land, the building, the business, the brand, everything ready and waiting &mdash; then here are the keys, from my hand to yours. <strong>Move in, and own it. It&rsquo;s yours.</strong>", a:"Naya holding out the keys in front of the NayaNET Franchise building, its checklist complete"}
